      "notes": [
        "The phrase when he defiled his father’s bed refers to Reuben having sexual relations with his father Jacob’s concubine Bilhah. This incident is recorded in Gen 35:22.",
        "Heb “and not to be listed in the genealogical records as (having) the right of the firstborn.”"
